<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Robotics EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Robotics EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Volpe, Welty &amp; Co said it trimmed its fiscal 1997 earnings estimates to $3.33 a share from $3.46 a share.</p>
<p>--Cut its fiscal 1998 earnings view to $4.24 a share from $4.43 a share.</p>
<p>-- Said adjusted estimates due to higher sales, marketing and interest expense.</p>
<p>-- Said continued to rate the company a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of $109 a share.</p>
<p>-- U.S. Robotics lost 2-1/8 to 71-1/2.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
